---
// LSM-tree playground: a DemoFrame around the LsmPlaygroundDemo island, plus its caption and styles.
import DemoFrame from './DemoFrame.astro';
import LsmPlaygroundDemo from '../demos/LsmPlaygroundDemo.tsx';
---
<figure class="lsmp-figure">
  <DemoFrame title="A tiny LSM-tree you can write to" titleVi="Một LSM-tree tí hon để bạn tự ghi">
    <LsmPlaygroundDemo client:visible />
  </DemoFrame>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>This is a simulation of a toy engine: the memtable holds 4 keys, a compaction starts when 4 SSTables pile up and merges all of them, and every record counts as 16 bytes. The write amplification it shows comes from the WAL, the flush and the compactions, the same three sources the book lists. Each Bloom filter here has only 32 bits, so false positives are easy to spot.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Đây là mô phỏng, không phải engine thật: memtable chứa 4 khoá, có 4 SSTable thì compaction chạy và trộn hết cả 4, mỗi bản ghi tính là 16 byte. Write amplification hiện ra đến từ WAL, từ flush và từ compaction, đúng ba nguồn mà sách liệt kê. Mỗi Bloom filter ở đây chỉ có 32 bit, nên dễ bắt gặp lúc nó báo nhầm.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style is:global>
  .lsmp-figure {
    margin: 2em 0;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .lsmp-figure > .demo-frame {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  .lsmp-figure > figcaption {
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.55;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .lsmp .sd-stat span,
  .bts .sd-stat span {
    text-transform: none;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .lsmp .sd-stat b span,
  .bts .sd-stat b span {
    font-size: inherit;
    font-weight: inherit;
    color: inherit;
  }
  .lsmp-label {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .lsmp-select {
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 13px;
    padding: 4px 8px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--card-bg);
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .lsmp-msg {
    min-height: 2.8em;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--text-body);
  }
  .lsmp-msg-line {
    display: block;
  }
  .lsmp-cols {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .lsmp-h {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .lsmp-box {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    padding: 8px 10px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--bg-alt);
  }
  .lsmp-box-title {
    margin: 0 0 6px;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .lsmp-box.is-read-skip {
    opacity: 0.45;
    border-style: dashed;
  }
  .lsmp-box.is-read-miss,
  .lsmp-box.is-read-fp {
    border-color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .lsmp-box.is-read-hit,
  .lsmp-box.is-read-deleted {
    border-color: var(--red);
    background: var(--red-tint-bg);
  }
  .lsmp-chips {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 4px;
  }
  .lsmp-chip {
    display: inline-flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    min-width: 46px;
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: var(--card-bg);
    line-height: 1.25;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .lsmp-chip b {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .lsmp-chip small {
    font-size: 10.5px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .lsmp-chip.is-tomb {
    border-style: dashed;
    border-color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .lsmp-chip.is-tomb b {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-decoration: line-through;
  }
  .lsmp-chip.is-hot {
    border-color: var(--red);
    border-width: 2px;
  }
  .lsmp-chip.is-empty {
    min-height: 34px;
    border-style: dashed;
    background: transparent;
  }
  .lsmp-none {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--text-faint);
  }
  .lsmp-bloom {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1px;
    margin-top: 6px;
  }
  .lsmp-bloom span {
    flex: 1 1 0;
    height: 6px;
    background: var(--border);
  }
  .lsmp-bloom span.is-set {
    background: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .lsmp-bloom span.is-probe {
    outline: 1.5px solid var(--red);
    outline-offset: 0;
  }
  .lsmp-path {
    margin: 4px 0 0;
    padding-left: 1.3em;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--text-body);
  }
  .lsmp-path li.is-skip {
    color: var(--text-faint);
  }
  .lsmp-path li.is-final {
    color: var(--red);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
</style>
